  document.body.appendChild(container);

  // MutationObserver (from HappyDOM) triggers our renderer

  This gives us the best of both worlds:
  - Mature DOM implementation from HappyDOM
  - Simple, terminal-focused styling system from us
  - No CSS complexity we don't need
  - Full control over the styling behavior

