  Text - Simple static text display

  - Purpose: Simple, static text rendering
  - Content handling: Uses Element's basic content property, renders directly to screen
  - Size: Auto-sizes to content by default
  - Scrolling: No scrolling capability
  - Text handling: Basic - just displays the text as-is
